        "## Processing the blade geometry\n",
        "After the iges files have been imported they come as one single curve for the entire blade. It may become necessary to split the blade into suction and pressure side with equal number of points. Some CFD meshing tools require a split of suction and pressure sides in order to effectively generate the mesh for leading and trailing edge.\n",
        "\n",
        "Lets load the function below"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 13,
      "id": "4ad070be",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "4ad070be"
